" Root's keys for vi.  vi knows the arrow keys, and Home (kh), from the
" termcap; these give it the other editing keys as an xterm, in the
" keypad mode vi sets, and the console's screens send them: End goes to
" the bottom of the screen as Home goes to the top, Page Up and Page Down
" move a screen, Delete deletes a character and Insert inserts.
map OF L
map [4~ L
map [5~ 
map [6~ 
map [3~ x
map [2~ i
